From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:33:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] appxdeploymentclient: PackageManager answers IAgileObject
 (3288)

The PackageManager (activation factory and instance) of appxdeploymentclient answers IAgileObject. A probe over the activation factories and default-constructed objects of the Windows.Web, Windows.Storage, Windows.Data.Json, Windows.Data.Xml, PropertySet, Package, Globalization and ThreadPool classes found everything else already agile. EasClientDeviceInformation, DeviceInformation and DeviceAccessInformation stay NOT agile: Wine's tests (real Windows) say so.

diff --git a/dlls/appxdeploymentclient/package.c b/dlls/appxdeploymentclient/package.c
index 562cd43..0f923bf 100644
--- a/dlls/appxdeploymentclient/package.c
+++ b/dlls/appxdeploymentclient/package.c
@@ -740,7 +740,7 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI factory_QueryInterface( IActivationFactory *iface, REFIID
     TRACE( "iface %p, iid %s, out %p.\n", iface, debugstr_guid( iid ), out );
 
     if (IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IUnknown ) ||
-        IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IInspectable ) ||
+        IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IInspectable ) || IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IAgileObject ) ||
         IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IActivationFactory ))
     {
         *out = &impl->IActivationFactory_iface;
